    "Plato's works (on forms/eidē and reality beyond spatiotemporal flux)"
  ],
  "autobiographical": [
    "2-3-74: PKD's visionary experience when he saw the Golden Fish sign and perceived the Acts grid superimposed on USA 1974, triggering anamnesis (remembering a secret Christian underground).",
    "11-17-80: Direct encounter with God's love, personality, and infinite bliss; God's theodicy answer about suffering being recompensed in the next life.",
    "6.5 years of exegetical work attempting to make intellectual sense of his experiences, now rendered secondary by the 11-17-80 encounter.",
    "Living outside spatiotemporal reality since Pentecost, unknowingly playing his role in the Acts drama until this moment of recognition."
  ],
  "theological_motifs": [
    "Anamnesis (remembering/recognition of hidden truth about oneself and history)",
    "Messianism (revolutionary, political, earthly kingdom rather than spiritual/otherworldly)",
    "The Second Coming (imminent, vital, real; prerequisite for overthrowing the Empire)",
    "Theodicy (God's justification of suffering through infinite compensatory bliss)",
    "Pentecost (beginning of the Acts age; contemporaneity with Christ for believers)",
    "Incarnation redefined (Christ camouflaged, discorporate, present in secret community)",
    "Saprophagy/saprophytism (Holy Spirit as living organism feeding on/through human consciousness)",
    "The Third Torah of Mercy (vs. justice; informational basis of reality)"
  ],
  "literary_self_ref": [
    "PKD's 'Tears' contains encoded Acts material; applying the Acts grid reveals King Felix (Christ) and Jason Taverner as secret Christian conspirator.",
    "'Tears' is a micro-model demonstrating how Acts works as an interpretive grid when applied to world itself.",
    "Jason Taverner's innocence reversed by Acts lens: he becomes seen as part of a secret underground rather than isolated individual.",
    "The dream within 'Tears' and external cyphers together confirm the Acts interpretation, validating PKD's fiction as theological artifact."
  ],
  "symbols_images": [
    "The Golden Fish sign (seen 2-3-74; triggers recognition of Acts grid and anamnesis)",
    "The LP groove as analogy (Acts is groove; information/Christ is music)",
    "The pink cube (reincarnation technique in monastic community from which Thomas emerged)",
    "The pitcher of water (monastic communist community detail)",
    "The Iron Empire (satanic worldly power; Rome and present authorities)",
    "The hologram (Acts as hologram projected by percipient's own brain, yet objectively real)",
    "Morphological arrangement (Platonic forms; timeless patterns beneath temporal flux)"
  ],
  "tensions": [
    "Acts appears arbitrary as a choice for encoding grid until PKD realizes it must relate to the Holy Spirit—yet why Acts specifically? He resolves this by asserting Acts is the Gospel of the Holy Spirit, but the necessity remains somewhat asserted rather than derived.",
    "Identity ambiguity: Is Thomas (Holy Spirit) the 'real me' that projected the hologram of Acts, or is PKD the percipient of Thomas's external revelation? The pronouns blur agency.",
    "Temporality paradox: PKD has been living outside space-time since Pentecost, yet experiences himself in temporal sequence; morphological arrangement claims to transcend flux but still operates within historical narrative.",
    "Intellectual vs. experiential knowing: PKD abandons 6.5 years of exegetical work when confronted by direct experience, suggesting intellectual theology is ultimately inadequate, yet the exegesis itself (this passage) continues.",
    "Satan's location: Is Satan the Empire's source or merely aligned with it? The text says Satan moves from antagonist to 'secret source' of the Empire, but metaphysical status remains unclear."
  ],
  "evidence_quotes": [
    "Acts is an encoding-decoding lens/grid by which the true historical Messianic role of the Xtians -vs the Empire- can instantly be seen; it converts the value signs in a flash.",
    "Just as: if you can see 'Tears' as Acts you can extract the information back out. In both cases the Acts grid is necessary if the information is to be extracted. Why Acts? Arbitrary? No. It must have to do with the Holy Spirit, since Acts is 'The Gospel of the Holy Spirit'!",
    "Thus all reality -past, present + future- is reappraised radically. Christ did not die to free men from their sins; he came as the Messiah to found a real, literal, actual millenial kingdom.",
    "The love + personality that God showed me on 11-17-80 make any intellectual understanding seem unimportant - pale + weak + dry + faded. Never have I known anything like that love; + the personality - it was as distinct as any human personality.",
    "He is really living in reality as interpreted through + by the Acts lens/grid. Thus he is a contemporary of Christ. + his own acts are part of the Acts of the Apostles."
  ],
  "uncertainty_flags": [
    "The identity and nature of 'Thomas': PKD calls him saprophytic life form and the Holy Spirit, but also 'the real me'—is Thomas an external entity or a dissociated aspect of PKD's consciousness? The text does not clarify.",
    "Medieval dating ambiguity: PKD notes that his visionary figure 'could be late Medieval, not first century' and mentions Templars and Illuminati, suggesting temporal displacement or multiple incarnations, but the textual basis for these speculations remains obscure.",
    "The pink cube and reincarnation techniques: PKD references these briefly from 'Tears,' but their theological significance is undeveloped; unclear whether they are literal or symbolic.",
    "The Encyclopædia Britannica article: PKD claims the E.B. article on 'Messianic Movements' validates his visions retroactively, but provides no direct quotation or precise reference; the causality (did the article inspire the vision, or did the vision interpret the article?) is ambiguous.",
    "The relationship between 2-3-74 and 11-17-80: PKD suggests 11-17-80 resolves a perceived lack of personality/love in 2-3-74, but whether these are stages of a single revelation or distinct encounters is not explicit.",
    "Acts as hologram: PKD asserts the Acts world is 'a hologram projected by my own brain,' yet elsewhere treats it as objective divine communication; the ontological status (projection vs. discovery) remains unresolved."
  ],
  "reading_excerpt": "The love + personality that God showed me on 11-17-80 make any intellectual understanding seem unimportant - pale + weak + dry + faded.",
